cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Toy Machine Learning Model for FAIR example"
version: 1.0.0
license: "MIT"
type: software
abstract: "This repository hosts the Jupyter Notebook of a Toy Machine Learning model that will be used as an example of FAIR principles applied to AI models at a very basic level. In particular, it contains a basic ML model, i.e., a classifier trained on the Iris dataset with the k-neighbors algorithm."
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
